
## `.gitignore`

Your `.gitignore` can be:

```gitignore
# Python cache files
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Log files
*.log
logs/

# Virtual environment
venv/
.venv/
env/

# VS Code settings
.vscode/

# PyCharm
.idea/

# Operating system files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Python build files
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/

# Test/cache files
.pytest_cache/
.coverage

# Environment / secret files
.env